Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.28,0:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.38,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that can't be beaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.02,0:00:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past every\Nwall that's in our wake!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.04,0:00:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Go without hesitation!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.78,0:00:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.86,0:00:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We just have to press on a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.70,0:00:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to the answers we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.28,0:00:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to this new world\Nbelieving that surely someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.98,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We just might find the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All the pieces of our dreams\Nhave now come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Our bonds won't waver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,With our dreaming hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on towards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.64,0:00:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A bright new future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise up the flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.50,0:01:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll get past everyone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on never stopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.46,0:01:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your head up. Way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.48,0:01:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.16,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If waves erupt up to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.06,0:01:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up. Our wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.48,0:01:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.84,0:01:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.06,0:01:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.54,0:01:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We drift on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.30,0:01:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Riding the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.92,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Towards another shore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.80,0:01:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,There are many meetings.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Many goodbyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.60,0:01:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Underneath the flag. We fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.54,0:01:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The pain within, I'll keep\Nit in my heart forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.96,0:01:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And never take it lightly,\Nbut I won't surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This freedom, I will keep in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.12,0:01:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll keep holding on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.68,0:01:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now everybody lift your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.52,0:01:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sing about what you are dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.58,0:02:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Always stand up, raise up\Nthe flag that you believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep up, we'll get past\Neveryone that's in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.32,0:02:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head on, never stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.92,0:02:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Only look up, keep your\Nhead up way up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.42,0:02:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Always step up, if waves are\Nrough, jump through the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.02,0:02:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Never give up, our wishes\Nthey will come together.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.76,0:02:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And lead us on for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you pirate scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.42,0:02:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The tanker is your territory\Nand you better stay on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This line here is the division\Nbetween good and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't you even dare\Nthink of crossing over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Them's the rules to live by, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell did you get an\Nidea to waste your time with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.94,0:02:52.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.85,0:02:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing I told you to do was\Nnot fraternize with the pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.42,0:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's no better way to enforce that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.42,0:02:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Men will respect the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We done determined that the line\Ndon't applicate to the medics, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.82,0:03:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I got into contact with the G5 base.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna wait right here\Nfor them to pick us up. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.96,0:03:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What? That's nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't turn yourself in, Brownbeard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.70,0:03:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like a waste since you\Nand my crew are friends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.14,0:03:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out Caesar was exposing his men to\Nsmall amounts of poison this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.46,0:03:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But they said the government will\Ntreat us if we hand ourselves over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.38,0:03:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell, Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I just told you not to\Nstep across the damn line!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.38,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean out your filthy ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.92,0:03:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I care?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.22,0:03:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your stupid rule, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.40,0:03:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I figure I would rather rot in\Nprison than die of Caesar's guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But, kid, I can't tell you how good\Nit felt to watch you clock Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.54,0:03:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.46,0:03:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, go with all your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wish somebody told me we\Nwere going to be using this tanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew we were going to have to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I would have found\Nanother place to brawl it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.44,0:04:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the screaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.98,0:04:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Chop, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to stop him, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's committing murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.53,0:04:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the murderer?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the heck are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.40,0:04:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Law is killing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.06,0:04:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, Traffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And why is Brooke freaking out?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I also committed a murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, Keenumon was already dead, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.54,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I shattered his body!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead and you shattered him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.10,0:04:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You killed him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.38,0:04:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to fix him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, fix him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.96,0:04:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,He was already dead before you broke him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What if we glue him back together?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.54,0:05:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you two not\Ngetting that he's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you attacking him, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.14,0:05:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.24,0:05:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just discussing how\Nhe's dead, and now he's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.16,0:05:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be happy about\Nit, not kicking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.58,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a reflex. Jeez, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.20,0:05:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.92,0:05:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy who they thought\Nwas killed is really alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.26,0:05:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so utterly relieved, Kin'emon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were gone for good. Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I feared that I would never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That kid's Momo?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:06:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, he said something\Nabout being a human once.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.95,0:06:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He is not normally this naked, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.36,0:06:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And poof!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.76,0:06:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This kimono suits you quite splendidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like a true son of Wado.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.12,0:06:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.44,0:06:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you know that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You sicko!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.96,0:06:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you do that to those poor kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw what you were doing\Nand you are gonna regret it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason I told\Nyou not to look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.50,0:06:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.16,0:06:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Why I would slice them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.14,0:06:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, there's drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This was the fastest way to get\Nthat poison out of their systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the raccoon's here! Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.64,0:06:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoon Wait, you guys are all okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.48,0:07:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The guy with the big puffy\Nhat just came to see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.32,0:07:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He cut the bad drugs out of our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was real scared at first,\Nbut I feel awesome now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.26,0:07:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He chopped us up into little\Npieces and it was real funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.02,0:07:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.98,0:07:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,He was helping them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.38,0:07:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of worried, though,\Nbecause Mocha still hasn't woken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.86,0:07:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,She was fighting to try to\Nsave all of us, wasn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The master was always so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.96,0:07:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea he was such a bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.18,0:07:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My memory's fuzzy, but I remember when\NMocha coughed her blood and passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.76,0:07:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoon, I'm actually a reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.58,0:07:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocha, she'll be okay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.56,0:07:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Can she still go home with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.82,0:07:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course she can.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.98,0:07:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're safe now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.38,0:07:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The nightmare's finally over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.26,0:07:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the lady with the orange hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.36,0:07:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she promised that she was\Ngoing to help us all get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.14,0:07:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And after everything she's done for\Nus, we wanted to tell her thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.04,0:07:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:07:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get you all home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.84,0:08:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's going to take you back\Nto your parents, safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.92,0:08:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But we don't want to go with the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What about the robot?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And the stretchy guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Or the guy with weird eyebrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, smells good. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what Sanji's cooking up for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.66,0:08:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.30,0:08:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's looking pretty straight to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just needs a super quick fix\Nand it'll be good to go. Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you manage to sort out\Na deal with the Marines?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.20,0:08:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.11,0:08:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave the\Nchildren in their hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I talked to Big Game about saving them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.56,0:08:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but I kind of doubt their parents would\Nbe too keen on pirates bringing them home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.42,0:08:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you got a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we've dealt with enough wrongful\Naccusations of kidnapping in our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Might as well just let the\Ngood guys take all the credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.40,0:08:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a bad history with most Marines,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.90,0:08:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but if they're women,\Nit's a different story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.86,0:09:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they make me feel safe
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.50,0:09:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, your mom was in the Navy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know how I forgot that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,She was, but that's beside the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You can always count on\Na strong female soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds gross when you say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.88,0:09:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just agreeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.30,0:09:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,New Kama Kimpo technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.84,0:09:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,99 fundamental recipes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.28,0:09:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A cold, exhausted body needs a healthy\Nheaping helping of fat and warmth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So I made hormone soup du\NGiri with sea pig pork.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.22,0:09:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you've been running on\Nan empty stomach for days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So start with the soup and eat it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.20,0:09:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I want it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet you're starving, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky, Sanji's the best cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not want this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.90,0:10:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot force me to\Neat your strange food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there, punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell are you doing with that bowl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.96,0:10:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you're a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone wastes food around me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, then I waste them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.86,0:10:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I gladly accept your fee. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.68,0:10:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey. Delicious! What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,My streak is returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,These delicacies you've prepared\Nare shockingly delectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.14,0:10:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.00,0:10:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Their food is fine to eat, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.26,0:10:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept their kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.98,0:10:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My life was saved on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and they were the ones who saved it—it was
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,a gift to have met such\Ntrustworthy people!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time, you haven't had\Na single bite to eat, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a strong boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.52,0:10:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It must have been awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You have nothing to worry about anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:11:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We must have faith that everyone\Nelse is alive and well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us choose to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.54,0:11:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You hear me, momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.94,0:11:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.02,0:11:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,that good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.94,0:11:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tasty enough to cry! Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.32,0:11:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They've clearly gone through some crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.48,0:11:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened\Nto those two? Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to your sacred
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.62,0:11:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,boundary between good and evil?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.46,0:11:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.37,0:11:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We're calling for a ceasefire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's the case—that's\Nthe booth from the tanker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.38,0:11:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to talk, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time to stick around and eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna be right on our tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.42,0:11:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,got to leave now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.48,0:11:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That bat huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:11:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your crew we've got a ship out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.78,0:12:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright I'll let
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,him know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.73,0:12:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.65,0:12:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,See you again and get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.92,0:12:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.83,0:12:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.90,0:12:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But father the true warriors shouldn't\Nallow themselves to weep in front of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.02,0:12:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In moments!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, little baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's to you, my brother. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch very closely now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.28,0:12:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lock!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.00,0:13:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're taking a team back to Caesar's lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.64,0:13:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We forced Caesar to tell\Nus the gas is weakness!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All our guys are still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're heading back to rescue him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.90,0:13:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.90,0:13:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Smoker still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.66,0:13:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, although I made you a promise,\Nyou can't possibly expect me to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.52,0:13:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.54,0:13:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you wanted to silence me, you had\Nplenty of opportunities to do it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Using Straw Hat, what\Nexactly are you planning?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.90,0:13:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Using him—what makes you\Nthink he's not using me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,there's four of them\Nright, so which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.84,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really need to know, I'm talking\Nabout kaido king of the beasts—sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as shanks isn't\Nfirst, I'm cool with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.02,0:14:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,with that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.16,0:14:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And besides, I'm already planning on\Ncrushing all four emperors anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You seriously think you can beat them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.74,0:14:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We share a common goal, but\NI warn you, it ain't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.74,0:14:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,These are the strongest\Nfighters in the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They've gone head-to-head with Whitebeard\Nand lived to tell about it, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.78,0:14:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,our target Kaido is considered the\Nmost powerful creature in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Creature?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not even human?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll work together to beat Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, our alliance comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're curious about our\Nchances of success, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.78,0:14:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,they're exceptionally low,\Nand I'll leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.64,0:14:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a plan—it's a suicide mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, in that case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.04,0:14:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.02,0:14:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,answer is yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.52,0:14:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What can we talk this\Nover for, just a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.08,0:14:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Not
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.24,0:15:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,that I wanted you alive—that's\Njust how it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't read into it, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.86,0:15:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,After we leave here, I'm thinking about\Nheading over to Green Bits. Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.90,0:15:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats may be useful, or maybe\NI'm the one who's useful to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.66,0:15:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,to them
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, for Marines,\Nyou guys aren't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're pirate scum, but\Nhell, I'd let you buy me a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.06,0:15:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you guys\Ndecided to use the tanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.94,0:15:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a plan, but you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.10,0:15:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami and Chopper are both\Nsaying we can't leave just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.16,0:15:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,At least not until we\Nmake sure the kids are
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.94,0:15:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,sailing away from Punk\NHazard safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That, and we don't want to sit around\Nand wait for more marines to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You have the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.28,0:16:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta take the kids and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.72,0:16:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, little tikes, on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.56,0:16:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is ready to go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this tanker belongs to\Nus now, here's the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.54,0:16:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about\Ncrossing over to our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.16,0:16:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the division\Nbetween good and evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.46,0:16:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep back, not one more\Nstep. What, this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.48,0:16:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were all just partying\Ntogether a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your point?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.08,0:16:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The party's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like we don't appreciate what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.56,0:16:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We are grateful for the meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, pirates are our sworn enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We're scumming the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.58,0:16:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise the sales!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.48,0:16:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.94,0:16:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what gives?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Naomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.03,0:16:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.72,0:16:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the robot? Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.90,0:16:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see the pirates\Nwith that thing in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.86,0:16:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trying to block their view?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.88,0:16:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:16:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a barrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Protecting the children from seeing you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.26,0:17:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we worked out\Nour issues here, G5!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we bros? Oh well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.74,0:17:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,At least they're safely aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.30,0:17:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We stand for justice! Cheer for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.84,0:17:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let these pirates\Ntry to fool you, kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.10,0:17:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,They're bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.10,0:17:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are only scum!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dregs of society!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But Marines stand for Law\Nand Order! Hurry! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.78,0:17:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the poisonous gas\Nfrom outside! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Better start running if you want to live!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tashigi mentioned she's\Ngoing to reach out to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.82,0:17:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk for assistance\Nfinding a cure for the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.50,0:17:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us see now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.14,0:17:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of the way, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of you want to say goodbye to\Nthe pirates, you're just rotten kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.30,0:17:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you want to thank them,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.80,0:17:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll drag you off the tanker\Nand leave you on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:18:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are good-for-nothing punks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Marines are where it's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But when we asked them for their help,\Nthey gave up without a second thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't even know who\Nwe were, what was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But they took us with them and\Nnever complained about our size.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.22,0:18:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We were slowing them down When can\Nwe leave this place and go home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, it'll happen soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.40,0:18:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just hang tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.44,0:18:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We were trapped on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.36,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one was going to come see us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But the pirates did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.68,0:18:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That we didn't get here\Nsooner to save you from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are filthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows they don't take baths.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.12,0:18:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,On the other hand, the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.60,0:18:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.36,0:18:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't let us say thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.96,0:18:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's worse than seasoners!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:18:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.94,0:19:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We are pirates, and the Navy is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy is brave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.20,0:19:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're brave and noble\Nand righteous! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.86,0:19:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This instant!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.34,0:19:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shame on you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.88,0:19:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You, you don't get into shaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.58,0:19:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to keep saying\Nbad things about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.94,0:19:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,or else we might we might\Ndo the unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We might end up liking these guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.94,0:19:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,even if they are pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Bunch of weirdos!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, pirate guys and gals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.18,0:20:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for saving all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.82,0:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When we grow up, you know what\Nwe want to be: Pirates like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.28,0:20:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.64,0:20:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time for us to head out to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why's this one tagging along with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.28,0:20:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess we forgot to tell\Nyou about the alliance we made.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.52,0:20:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.76,0:20:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time we see you, you\Nwon't get off so easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.86,0:20:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be ready for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.06,0:20:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,OK!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.48,0:20:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll lock you up and throw away the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.04,0:20:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if the Straw\NHats made a deal with the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If the weather was cloudy, I could have\Ntaken my sky path straight to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.98,0:21:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.30,0:21:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.34,0:21:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was law!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That traitor was in with the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.40,0:21:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And we let it happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I was dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.74,0:21:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You needed me, and now I'm just a burden!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.46,0:21:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.26,0:21:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the life yacht that\Nwas on our tanker, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.80,0:21:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost too ashamed to\Nsay, but after I hung up...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.52,0:21:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.74,0:21:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fill in the blanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,All you did was follow\Nthe orders I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.22,0:21:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, color me surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.72,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect you to show up in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.10,0:21:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been far too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A real shame you didn't\Nchoose to show your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.42,0:21:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I figure you want to know where Caesar is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.54,0:21:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's safely in our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.60,0:21:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker, where the hell\Nare you? They got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.24,0:21:58.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Question regarding the state of my\Ncohort's bodies. Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.28,0:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't say, nor does it\Nparticularly interest me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.28,0:22:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.86,0:22:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,come on lock get serious\Nhere stop pretending
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,you're an adult and let's cut to the chase
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.04,0:22:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,tell me where are you\Nright now answer quicker
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I may get mad oh you'll\Nget mad and what about
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,your business partner\Nwhat's his name I keep
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.98,0:22:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,forgetting that's right\NKaido King of the beasts
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and one of the four\Nemperors now i'm just a brat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.52,0:22:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but if there's anyone\Nyou'd want to keep from
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,getting angry i think it'd be him i wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.24,0:22:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,how he might react after\Nhe finds out you can't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.88,0:22:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,produce smile who knows\Nbut he doesn't strike me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.84,0:22:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,as the bargaining type i\Nimagine a fierce battle
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:23:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,would ensue master your\Nturn of blue when it's
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,over you'll be gone all\Nright you've carried the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.96,0:23:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,joke far enough so let's\Ndiscuss the terms like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,grown-ups what do you\Nwant to trade for caesar
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.50,0:23:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,resign from the seven warlords that's\Nall can you believe the nerve of
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.10,0:23:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,this punk if joker quits he'll be\Nforced to leave dress rosa come now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.34,0:23:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm only asking for you to abandon\Na decade of hard work to go back to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.94,0:23:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,being a simple pirate unfortunately\Nonce that happens the navy admirals at
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.74,0:23:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,headquarters won't be able to turn\Na blind eye to you any longer you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.40,0:23:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,have until tomorrow if I look in\Nthe morning paper and see a headline
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.32,0:23:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,announcing your resignation from the\Nwarlords then I will call you and the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.00,0:23:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,deal is on but if I don't see it then
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.72,0:23:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,my offer is as good as dead so long
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.32,0:23:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a damn minute! Law!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.66,0:24:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Young Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.70,0:24:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kill that brat.
